  <h1>Bible Audiobook — Audio Fidelity Audit</h1>
  <p class="av-sub">Independent verification that the generated ElevenLabs narration speaks the BSB text faithfully — no dropped words, added words, or misread passages. Completed 2026&#8209;09&#8209;16.</p>

  <div class="av-verdict">
    <span class="av-badge">PASS · 0 CONFIRMED DEFECTS</span>
    <p>All 66 books / 1,189 chapters were transcribed back to text by two independent speech-recognition engines and compared to the source. No dropped word, added word, or misread passage was confirmed. Mean word-error rate 1.83% — the residual is expected recognition noise, not audio error.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="av-tiles">
    <div class="av-tile"><div class="n">66</div><div class="l">Books</div></div>
    <div class="av-tile"><div class="n">1,189</div><div class="l">Chapters scanned</div></div>
    <div class="av-tile"><div class="n">1.83%</div><div class="l">Mean word-error rate</div></div>
    <div class="av-tile"><div class="n">0</div><div class="l">Confirmed defects</div></div>
